---
source: intear-dex-management/tests/dex_lifecycle.rs
expression: "without_code_size(cli.transaction(\"slimedragon.near\",\n&[\"xyk\", \"deploy\", \"slimedragon.near\", \"--name\", \"xyk-test\", \"use-file\",\nxyk_wasm_path]).await).replace(xyk_wasm_path, \"[TEMP]/xyk_dex.wasm\")"
---
$ near-intear-dex-management xyk deploy slimedragon.near --name xyk-test use-file [TEMP]/xyk_dex.wasm network-config sandbox sign-with-plaintext-private-key ed25519:3Jr44c7TzFcexmD2nYX7qD5Vm8td8GdDqTK4MvRKi6mCijP254c7sRtTvYDLF3kngAuBosWUkGokz1qYLZSkNyrn send
exit code: 0
